  "label": "User projected onto the father figure in the visual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the adult male (father figure) in the visual material. This projection is implied by the meme's framing, where the father is the one responding to the child's question, and the user, as the viewer, is positioned as the one observing this interaction. The deictic 'dad' in the text explicitly labels the visual entity, creating a direct mapping that invites the user to identify with or project themselves onto the father figure's role in the scene.",
